From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:11:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] ipa: simple: Tune the Pixel 7 Pro's ultrawide and main
 cameras

Both cameras have an AK7375 focus lens: enable the contrast autofocus,
with fewer and coarser steps for the ultrawide, whose depth of field is
deep, than for the main camera.

Give the IMX386 a stand-in colour matrix: the IMX519 matrices from the
Raspberry Pi tuning in src/ipa/rpi/vc4/data/imx519.json (BSD-2-Clause),
another Sony mobile-class sensor with a similar pixel. Without a matrix
the software ISP shows the sensor's own, washed-out colours. The S5KGN1
gets the identity until it is calibrated, so its saturation default
applies.

Set a contrast default of 1.2 on both, and a saturation default of 1.1
on the main camera, for applications that do not set the controls.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/ipa/simple/data/imx386.yaml | 50 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/ipa/simple/data/s5kgn1.yaml | 24 ++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ipa/simple/data/imx386.yaml b/src/ipa/simple/data/imx386.yaml
index 22a1d2a..768e63d 100644
--- a/src/ipa/simple/data/imx386.yaml
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/imx386.yaml
@@ -1,13 +1,57 @@
-# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0 AND BSD-2-Clause
 #
-# Sony IMX386 (the Pixel 7 Pro's ultrawide), not calibrated yet: the
-# uncalibrated set with the sensor's black level from its helper.
+# Sony IMX386 (the Pixel 7 Pro's ultrawide), not calibrated yet. The black
+# level comes from the sensor's helper.
+#
+# The colour matrices are a stand-in: the IMX519 matrices from libcamera's
+# src/ipa/rpi/vc4/data/imx519.json (rpi.ccm), Copyright 2019-2020
+# Raspberry Pi Ltd, BSD-2-Clause (see REUSE.toml and
+# LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt). The IMX519 is another Sony mobile-class
+# Bayer sensor with a similar pixel (1.22 um against 1.25 um), and any
+# such matrix is closer to the truth than none: without one the software
+# ISP shows the sensor's own, washed-out colours. Replace them with a
+# calibration of this sensor.
+#
+# Autofocus scans the AK7375 lens's range in 4 coarse steps, then around
+# the sharpest one in steps of 1/12 of the range: an ultrawide's depth of
+# field is deep.
 %YAML 1.1
 ---
 version: 1
 algorithms:
   - BlackLevel:
   - Awb:
+  - Ccm:
+      ccms:
+        - ct: 2890
+          ccm: [ 1.36754, -0.18448, -0.18306,
+                -0.32356,  1.44826, -0.12471,
+                -0.00412, -0.69936,  1.70348 ]
+        - ct: 2920
+          ccm: [ 1.26704,  0.01624, -0.28328,
+                -0.28516,  1.38934, -0.10419,
+                -0.04854, -0.82211,  1.87066 ]
+        - ct: 3550
+          ccm: [ 1.42836, -0.27235, -0.15601,
+                -0.28751,  1.41075, -0.12325,
+                -0.01812, -0.54849,  1.56661 ]
+        - ct: 4500
+          ccm: [ 1.36328, -0.19569, -0.16759,
+                -0.25254,  1.52248, -0.26994,
+                -0.01575, -0.53155,  1.54729 ]
+        - ct: 5700
+          ccm: [ 1.49207, -0.37245, -0.11963,
+                -0.21493,  1.40005, -0.18512,
+                -0.03781, -0.38779,  1.42561 ]
+        - ct: 7900
+          ccm: [ 1.34849, -0.05425, -0.29424,
+                -0.22182,  1.77684, -0.55502,
+                -0.07403, -0.55336,  1.62739 ]
+  # Defaults for applications that do not set the controls.
   - Adjust:
+      contrast: 1.2
   - Agc:
+  - Af:
+      coarseSteps: 4
+      fineSteps: 12
 ...
diff --git a/src/ipa/simple/data/s5kgn1.yaml b/src/ipa/simple/data/s5kgn1.yaml
index b447360..508c1e0 100644
--- a/src/ipa/simple/data/s5kgn1.yaml
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/s5kgn1.yaml
@@ -1,13 +1,33 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
 #
-# Samsung S5KGN1 (the Pixel 7 Pro's main camera), not calibrated yet: the
-# uncalibrated set with the sensor's black level from its helper.
+# Samsung S5KGN1 (the Pixel 7 Pro's main camera), not calibrated yet. The
+# black level comes from the sensor's helper.
+#
+# The colour matrix is the identity until a calibration: a matrix from
+# another manufacturer's sensor would be a guess. Having one lets the
+# saturation default apply.
+#
+# Autofocus scans the AK7375 lens's range in 8 coarse steps, then around
+# the sharpest one in steps of 1/32 of the range: the main camera's large
+# sensor and fast lens give a shallow depth of field.
 %YAML 1.1
 ---
 version: 1
 algorithms:
   - BlackLevel:
   - Awb:
+  - Ccm:
+      ccms:
+        - ct: 5000
+          ccm: [ 1, 0, 0,
+                 0, 1, 0,
+                 0, 0, 1 ]
+  # Defaults for applications that do not set the controls.
   - Adjust:
+      contrast: 1.2
+      saturation: 1.1
   - Agc:
+  - Af:
+      coarseSteps: 8
+      fineSteps: 32
 ...
